+/*
+ * Warm reset of the modem through its own PMIC.  Register layout and sequence
+ * are qpnp_pon_modem_pwr_off(PON_POWER_OFF_WARM_RESET) from the downstream
+ * tree; the base comes from the stock overlay's qcom,power-on@800.
